{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳一段車Cam片，事發時現場路況相當繁忙，車Cam車主正沿著右線行駛，當車輛駛至一處路口時，一名男子騎着單車突然由左方貨車的盲點位置「鬼探頭」直衝出路口，險些與車Cam車輛發生相撞。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-18-12h55m49s737.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026uqvQLoOizH1789714073.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-18-12h55m49s737.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-18-12h55m54s919.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026CHIpHSqezP1789714081.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-18-12h55m54s919.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">面對突如其來的「鬼探頭」單車，幸好車Cam司機反應快，即時收慢車速，最終化險為夷，未有釀成交通意外。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">大批網民斥責單車男子的騎車態度，怒轟其完全無視道路安全，留言直指：「讓線直出好危險」、「睇都唔睇下車」，更有網民痛批其為「亡命單車手」。同時不少網民亦對車Cam司機的極速反應大加讚賞，紛紛留言表示：「好彩反應快」，更有網民直言司機及時煞停「救咗佢一命。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T07:17:30.186306+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":273,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}